<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-SocGen ups House of Fraser.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-SocGen ups House of Fraser.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department stores group House of Fraser Plc was raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at SocGen, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Separately House of Fraser was highlighted in a note from chart analysts at Merrill Lynch. They said the stock seemed to have bottomed out and could rebound to 220p or 255p, with resistance seen at 190p.</p>
<p>House of Fraser shares were unchanged at 187p by 0908 GMT, having risen sharply from around 160p at the start of July.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
